# A long chat opened, left and opened again must show its last messages, not an empty feed (the lazy feed landing past
# its last row on an estimated height, v0.80.0). Seed it with `fixture_server.py act ... rich ada 160`; every
# `feedgeom` line must end in "shown", never "BLANK". Repeat a few runs: it failed 3 times in 5 before the fix.
open ada
until
wait 2
feedgeom
open tundra
until
wait 1
open ada
until
wait 2
feedgeom
scrollfeed -300 3
feedgeom
quit
